WEBVTT

00:07.810 --> 00:11.400
<i>Well, at least it's 
not using its claws anymore.</i>

00:11.970 --> 00:15.910
<i>But man, I sure wasn't expecting 
that many Skullfaces.</i>

00:16.280 --> 00:18.160
<i>I'd better report to the guild.</i>

00:19.270 --> 00:22.490
I guess I won't tell them about 
the Elementail for now.

00:23.940 --> 00:25.420
I've got a question for you.

00:25.880 --> 00:27.540
Want to form a contract with me?

00:29.800 --> 00:31.340
It's called taming.

00:31.340 --> 00:33.800
A tamer and monster form a partnership.

00:33.800 --> 00:38.660
It'll keep your level and species hidden, 
and we can stick together all the time.

00:40.740 --> 00:42.810
Okay, okay.

00:43.300 --> 00:44.740
Welp, here goes.

00:50.620 --> 00:54.020
It is my desire to walk with you.

01:03.990 --> 01:05.690
Here's to working together!

01:07.330 --> 01:10.890
Now that we've formed a contract, 
there's something we should do.

01:11.820 --> 01:13.820
You need a name.

01:15.870 --> 01:18.840
C-Calm down. You're shaking my head.

01:20.150 --> 01:24.980
Anyway, what do you think of the name Yuzuha?

01:28.480 --> 01:30.420
Sounds like you like it.

01:31.980 --> 01:34.150
<b>You have a new message</b>

01:32.530 --> 01:33.890
Must be from Tiera.

01:34.190 --> 01:35.240
<b>Dear Shin,

I was able to send a message to my master. I don't know if she has
any message cards, but I'll let you know if I hear back from her.

P.S. Is it possible to attach items to cards and send them??</b>

01:35.240 --> 01:40.590
"Dear Shin, I was able to send 
a message to my master."

01:41.100 --> 01:45.500
I hadn't really considered that Tiera 
might actually reach her.

01:46.530 --> 01:48.950
"Say hello to Schnee for me."

01:50.540 --> 01:52.930
Okay, let's head to the guild.

03:25.620 --> 03:29.600
Excuse me. I have something to report.

03:30.090 --> 03:31.460
Go ahead.

03:32.100 --> 03:34.610
Um, who should I speak to?

03:34.610 --> 03:35.850
I'll handle—

03:35.850 --> 03:37.780
I'll take your report.

03:37.780 --> 03:38.890
Cilica.

03:38.890 --> 03:39.740
What?

03:40.050 --> 03:44.370
Shin is standing in front of me. 
I'll take his report.

03:44.370 --> 03:46.760
What? Why can't I take it?

03:46.760 --> 03:48.380
You just can't. I'll do it.

03:48.380 --> 03:50.730
That's not like you.

03:50.730 --> 03:51.370
Excuse me?

03:51.370 --> 03:55.200
Fine, fine. I'll be quiet.

03:55.200 --> 03:57.380
Uh, can I make my report now?

03:57.380 --> 04:00.610
Yes. I'm sorry for the trouble.

04:00.610 --> 04:02.380
Go right ahead.

04:03.650 --> 04:05.820
I'm glad I got to report in.

04:06.900 --> 04:09.270
While we're here, let's check out other jobs.

04:13.770 --> 04:15.780
A skill successor?

04:13.770 --> 04:17.270
Looking for Skill Successor

If interested, please come to the orphanage next to the church in the west ward

04:15.780 --> 04:17.270
Is that a term for a skill holder?

04:17.930 --> 04:21.500
<i>It's an unranked job. 
Must be something special to it.</i>

04:21.500 --> 04:23.780
<i>It's from the church orphanage.</i>

04:24.450 --> 04:26.910
<i>Please save the fox.</i>

04:27.220 --> 04:30.410
<i>I'm curious about that power, too.</i>

04:30.410 --> 04:32.890
Looking for Skill Successor

If interested, please come to the orphanage next to the church in the west ward

04:30.970 --> 04:32.890
<i>I'm on my way to see Millie anyway.</i>

04:39.620 --> 04:41.420
May I help you?

04:42.550 --> 04:45.930
Oh, pardon me. I've never been 
to a place like this before.

04:46.450 --> 04:48.840
I'm here because I have 
business with the orphanage.

04:48.840 --> 04:50.930
Did you see my job request?

04:51.300 --> 04:53.900
I thought I'd at least see what it's about.

04:53.900 --> 04:57.110
Also, is there a beast girl named Millie here?

04:57.740 --> 04:59.540
What of her?

04:59.540 --> 05:01.630
She asked me to do something for her.

05:03.690 --> 05:05.200
This way.

05:07.450 --> 05:09.090
It's Shin!

05:09.880 --> 05:10.780
Millie!

05:11.680 --> 05:12.860
Shin!

05:15.030 --> 05:17.710
It would seem you're not a bad person.

05:18.090 --> 05:20.010
Is that how you saw me?

05:21.300 --> 05:25.720
Forgive me. It's been a while since Millie 
took such a liking to someone.

05:26.050 --> 05:28.790
I'm Shin, an adventurer.

05:29.290 --> 05:33.010
My name is Tria. I'm a nun at this church.

05:33.420 --> 05:36.740
Can I ask Millie about 
what I mentioned earlier?

05:36.740 --> 05:37.350
Yes.

05:37.660 --> 05:42.070
Say, Millie, is this the fox
you were talking about yesterday?

05:42.070 --> 05:44.970
Yeah, it is! Thanks!

05:44.970 --> 05:46.450
You're welcome.

05:46.450 --> 05:48.490
Yuzuha, say thank you.

05:48.980 --> 05:51.770
I was able to rescue you because of Millie.

05:57.870 --> 06:02.010
Now, could you tell me
 more about your request?

06:02.010 --> 06:08.540
Yes. If you came after seeing it, 
then you must have a skill.

06:08.540 --> 06:09.760
Well, yeah.

06:10.410 --> 06:15.520
<i>Skill holders were common in the game, 
but I guess they're a lot more rare now.</i>

06:15.970 --> 06:19.680
In truth, I'm looking for someone
who inherited a certain skill

06:19.680 --> 06:22.270
so they can teach it to me.

06:22.740 --> 06:26.530
Given your profession, 
is it something like Heal or Cure?

06:26.530 --> 06:29.780
No, actually. There are 
other circumstances at play.

06:30.330 --> 06:33.120
I... need Purify.

06:33.120 --> 06:35.300
Oh, Purify?

06:35.300 --> 06:38.580
I know I'm asking for a lot.

06:38.580 --> 06:40.640
Yeah, that's a really tough one.

06:40.640 --> 06:42.560
I'm sure it is.

06:42.560 --> 06:44.550
Wait, what did you just say?

06:44.880 --> 06:47.550
Er, I said it's a tough ask.

06:49.130 --> 06:52.930
Do you perchance know how
to teach it to someone?

06:52.930 --> 06:54.740
Yeah, I do.

06:54.740 --> 06:57.680
S-So you can fulfill the job?

06:58.970 --> 07:00.690
That depends on you.

07:01.850 --> 07:03.880
Regarding the reward...

07:03.880 --> 07:06.440
I don't need any monetary compensation.

07:06.840 --> 07:10.560
Instead, I'd like to know 
about Millie's power.

07:10.560 --> 07:15.210
I'd also like you to share whatever 
information the church acquires.

07:16.140 --> 07:18.020
<i>Of course she's at a loss.</i>

07:18.020 --> 07:20.830
<i>I'm a stranger who showed up out of nowhere.</i>

07:21.590 --> 07:24.610
<i>There's so much I don't know 
about this world.</i>

07:24.610 --> 07:28.130
<i>I'd love to have the church
as an intel resource,</i>

07:28.130 --> 07:30.210
<i>but what should I do?</i>

07:30.210 --> 07:31.530
He's okay.

07:34.050 --> 07:35.720
Shin is okay.

07:38.000 --> 07:39.010
Millie.

07:41.300 --> 07:44.480
Very well. I accept your terms.

07:44.810 --> 07:47.610
But we're not experts.

07:47.610 --> 07:51.160
I'm not sure we'll be able to 
gather information for you.

07:51.160 --> 07:56.370
I just need to know if anyone comes
to the church saying anything of interest.

07:56.770 --> 08:00.540
The nature of Millie's power is the more 
important part to me anyway.

08:01.540 --> 08:04.880
Millie possesses the title "Star Composer."

08:05.390 --> 08:06.620
Star Composer?

08:07.210 --> 08:10.380
She sometimes has unexpected visions.

08:11.070 --> 08:15.140
And they've never been wrong before.

08:15.140 --> 08:16.860
So she can predict the future.

08:16.860 --> 08:22.390
Yes. Perhaps she asked you for a favor 
because she saw something.

08:22.770 --> 08:25.680
If people found out about Millie's power,

08:25.680 --> 08:28.740
there are those who would use it
 for nefarious purposes.

08:29.130 --> 08:32.650
I've warned my associates
to be wary of who they mention it to.

08:33.110 --> 08:36.930
There's an adventurer from here 
who provides us with assistance.

08:36.930 --> 08:38.460
You mean Wilhelm?

08:38.460 --> 08:39.160
Yes.

08:39.480 --> 08:44.040
Most people leave our children alone 
for fear of him.

08:44.450 --> 08:47.460
In that case, I'd formally
like to accept the job.

08:47.460 --> 08:50.570
Tria, are you the one 
who will be learning Purify?

08:50.570 --> 08:54.380
No, I was thinking of asking 
another of our sisters to learn it.

08:54.380 --> 08:56.050
I figured it would be you...

08:56.050 --> 08:59.520
Our former priest has a granddaughter.

08:59.520 --> 09:04.550
Things would go more smoothly 
if she were to inherit the church.

09:05.050 --> 09:08.060
<i>Sounds like a sticky situation.</i>

09:09.110 --> 09:10.940
It's a fox!

09:11.240 --> 09:12.280
I wanna hold it!

09:12.280 --> 09:13.290
Me first!

09:13.290 --> 09:14.440
No, me.

09:13.490 --> 09:14.440
Me too!

09:19.070 --> 09:21.080
<i>All alone...</i>

09:19.370 --> 09:21.080
<b>All alone</b>

09:23.100 --> 09:25.850
<b>All alone</b>

09:24.500 --> 09:26.120
Hang in there.

09:26.120 --> 09:28.080
<i>Why do I feel so defeated?</i>

09:28.830 --> 09:32.620
Well, I can't expect them to take
 a shine to a total stranger.

09:33.730 --> 09:36.240
Millie, don't you want to see Yuzuha too?

09:36.240 --> 09:37.540
I'd lose.

09:37.540 --> 09:39.380
You'd... lose?

09:39.380 --> 09:40.100
Yeah.

09:40.770 --> 09:45.350
<i>She's right. Millie's a bit small 
to force her way in there.</i>

09:52.310 --> 09:53.820
Come here, Yu.

09:56.330 --> 09:58.830
Now I've got you all to myself.

09:59.810 --> 10:01.840
Don't tell me you're a little schemer!

10:01.840 --> 10:03.240
Easy win.

10:03.240 --> 10:05.000
That's exactly what it sounds like!

10:15.230 --> 10:18.010
Are you the one who's going to save us?

10:18.430 --> 10:22.260
<i>"Us"? Not the nun?</i>

10:22.260 --> 10:23.510
What do you mean?

10:23.950 --> 10:27.300
The nun said they might
get rid of this place.

10:27.300 --> 10:29.020
They're getting rid of the church?

10:29.490 --> 10:32.270
No, just the orphanage.

10:32.990 --> 10:34.900
Will you tell me more about that?

10:35.750 --> 10:38.900
This church doesn't have a priest right now,

10:39.530 --> 10:42.730
so a new one has to take over.

10:42.730 --> 10:44.890
Can't Tria do that?

10:45.470 --> 10:48.660
It has to be someone 
who can use a special skill.

10:49.140 --> 10:52.140
<i>So that's why she needs Purify.</i>

10:52.140 --> 10:56.550
The new priest wants 
to get rid of the orphanage.

10:56.950 --> 10:59.690
But the nun says the old priest's
granddaughter, Lacia,

10:59.690 --> 11:02.550
might have a superior claim to the church.

11:02.970 --> 11:06.140
<i>Our former priest has a granddaughter.</i>

11:06.460 --> 11:10.620
<i>So that's why she wants 
another nun to learn the skill.</i>

11:11.070 --> 11:16.770
But why would a priest of this church 
want to do away with the orphanage?

11:17.330 --> 11:20.110
We don't like him.

11:21.810 --> 11:23.280
What's he like?

11:24.660 --> 11:26.790
He's a pig who only cares about money.

11:26.790 --> 11:30.900
Yeah, okay. That tells me 
everything I need to know.

11:30.900 --> 11:32.170
It's okay.

11:32.170 --> 11:34.290
Shin will save us.

11:35.410 --> 11:37.800
If you say so, Millie, maybe we'll be okay.

11:38.470 --> 11:40.880
Does Millie tend to be right?

11:40.880 --> 11:46.180
Yeah. She always knows which shops have
good deals and where the snacks are hidden.

11:46.180 --> 11:49.430
Not exactly what I meant, but okay.

11:50.110 --> 11:54.200
<i>Sounds like Millie's careful 
about who she shares things with.</i>

11:54.200 --> 11:55.330
Is that weird?

11:55.330 --> 11:58.690
No, it's not weird. If anything, it's good.

11:59.070 --> 12:00.820
As long as you're not straining yourself.

12:01.380 --> 12:02.950
I like head pats.

12:08.450 --> 12:10.610
Thank you for waiting, Shin.

12:21.700 --> 12:23.840
Say hello, Lacia.

12:23.840 --> 12:27.170
R-Right. I'm Sister Lacia.

12:27.170 --> 12:30.850
Thank you for helping ush— I mean, us.

12:31.170 --> 12:32.420
Um...

12:32.420 --> 12:33.930
Are you all right?

12:33.930 --> 12:38.230
She can be a bit careless, 
but I promise she's hardworking.

12:38.810 --> 12:42.860
I'm Shin. I'm going to teach you 
how to use the Purify skill.

12:43.390 --> 12:48.010
Just remember that whether or not 
you can learn it depends on you.

12:48.010 --> 12:48.870
Okay!

12:49.790 --> 12:51.650
First, I have a question.

12:52.050 --> 12:56.500
Do you know where large numbers 
of high-level undead appear?

12:56.500 --> 12:59.500
The Ghost Plains are rather famous.

12:59.820 --> 13:01.350
The Ghost Plains?

13:02.890 --> 13:06.400
So you're the adventurer who took the job.

13:06.400 --> 13:08.890
Oh, Wil, you're back?

13:09.200 --> 13:10.920
Hey. I'm just stopping by.

13:10.920 --> 13:11.950
Wil.

13:12.740 --> 13:15.390
What are you after? What did they tell you?

13:15.740 --> 13:19.720
About Millie and the adventurer 
from the orphanage

13:19.720 --> 13:22.860
who helps them keep her secret.

13:23.750 --> 13:25.780
You shouldn't be so trusting.

13:26.100 --> 13:28.210
He doesn't seem like a bad person.

13:28.210 --> 13:32.290
Besides, Millie said it would be okay.

13:33.100 --> 13:34.290
Did you see something?

13:35.340 --> 13:36.290
Yeah.

13:37.130 --> 13:38.290
I see.

13:38.570 --> 13:40.750
Is that all?

13:41.660 --> 13:44.300
If Millie says so, then I trust you.

13:44.300 --> 13:48.880
Don't worry. I won't tell anyone 
or do anything underhanded.

13:48.880 --> 13:50.050
You'd better not.

13:50.530 --> 13:53.560
If you do, I'll use this to kill you.

13:54.980 --> 13:58.180
No fighting. You're so fussy, Wil!

13:58.820 --> 14:02.540
I'm sorry. He's always been short-tempered.

14:02.540 --> 14:04.570
Wil is impatient.

14:04.920 --> 14:06.210
Hey.

14:06.210 --> 14:08.060
That's a harsh review.

14:08.060 --> 14:11.580
Whatever. Tell us about Purify.

14:12.410 --> 14:13.980
Don't tell anyone else.

14:13.980 --> 14:15.080
Wouldn't dream of it.

14:17.730 --> 14:22.010
To acquire Purify, you must 
defeat 200 undead over level 150

14:22.010 --> 14:25.990
while holding an item called 
a holy prayer orb.

14:26.840 --> 14:29.810
Landing the finishing blow counts as a kill,

14:29.810 --> 14:33.350
so I'll weaken the monsters 
and Lacia can polish them off.

14:33.680 --> 14:35.650
Wait, are you serious?

14:35.650 --> 14:40.230
Yes. Acquiring a holy prayer orb 
is actually pretty difficult,

14:40.560 --> 14:43.200
but I already have one, so we're good.

14:43.200 --> 14:46.740
You're saying such remarkable
 things so casually...

14:47.170 --> 14:49.820
Lacia, are you gonna be okay?

14:51.070 --> 14:51.780
Hey!

14:51.780 --> 14:52.850
Yes!

14:54.210 --> 14:56.740
Shin, I'm coming with you.

14:56.740 --> 14:58.570
Sure. You're welcome to.

14:58.570 --> 15:01.120
Lacia, good luck.

15:01.120 --> 15:02.500
I-I'll do my best.

15:03.530 --> 15:04.750
I'm counting on you.

15:05.660 --> 15:06.760
Of course.

15:09.250 --> 15:11.760
<i>There's too much I don't know about him.</i>

15:12.190 --> 15:16.770
<i>Millie likes him, so at the very least, 
he's probably not dangerous.</i>

15:17.180 --> 15:20.090
<i>But I don't buy that some no-name novice</i>

15:20.090 --> 15:26.270
<i>can take on loads of monsters 
over level 150, all while carrying Lacia.</i>

15:26.810 --> 15:30.280
<i>The only conceivable explanation is...</i>

15:30.700 --> 15:32.980
We leave tomorrow morning.

15:32.980 --> 15:35.260
When we get home, let's eat and retire early.

15:38.070 --> 15:39.310
Wilhelm?

15:41.220 --> 15:42.930
Come with me.

15:44.420 --> 15:46.040
I want to confirm something.

15:46.730 --> 15:49.050
Are you a chosen one?

15:49.850 --> 15:51.050
A chosen one?

15:51.360 --> 15:52.800
You don't know what those are?

15:52.800 --> 15:54.300
Not a clue.

15:54.740 --> 16:01.810
Chosen ones are people born with skills, 
titles, and knowledge they shouldn't have.

16:01.810 --> 16:04.810
Does that include memories of previous lives?

16:05.170 --> 16:08.820
No, mostly information 
about items and monsters.

16:09.250 --> 16:14.030
I've never heard of anyone 
remembering a past life.

16:14.030 --> 16:14.820
I see.

16:15.300 --> 16:19.480
<i>People starting off 
with multiple skills and titles?</i>

16:19.480 --> 16:21.830
<i>Does that mean the reincarnation 
system still works?</i>

16:22.190 --> 16:23.900
Sound familiar to you?

16:23.900 --> 16:26.210
Not exactly...

16:26.950 --> 16:29.400
<i>I've reincarnated within the game before,</i>

16:29.400 --> 16:32.220
<i>but I wasn't reborn 
in this world as an infant.</i>

16:32.750 --> 16:35.930
<i>High humans are apparently extinct, too.</i>

16:35.930 --> 16:39.470
No matter. I won't make you 
tell me everything.

16:40.340 --> 16:41.420
I appreciate it.

16:41.420 --> 16:45.490
By the way, most people have
never heard of chosen ones.

16:45.490 --> 16:47.650
Careful who you mention that to.

16:49.050 --> 16:52.110
You're surprisingly caring, Wilhelm.

16:52.110 --> 16:54.040
Are you sure people are afraid of you?

16:54.040 --> 16:58.400
I can't help what others think of me.

16:58.400 --> 17:01.030
You're a hero who protects an orphanage.

17:02.080 --> 17:07.280
The kids are crying because some greedy 
pig won't stop messing with them.

17:07.280 --> 17:08.750
The sound grates on my ears.

17:09.270 --> 17:12.460
So you're stopping this guy
 to shut them up, huh?

17:12.460 --> 17:14.260
That's right.

17:15.220 --> 17:19.570
<i>Crap! I always had a feeling,
but he's seriously a nice guy!</i>

17:19.570 --> 17:20.320
What?

17:20.330 --> 17:21.380
Uh...

17:21.380 --> 17:23.260
Nothing. It's nothing.

17:24.950 --> 17:25.920
Sorry. One second.

17:25.920 --> 17:26.520
Huh?

17:26.520 --> 17:27.440
<b>You have a new message</b>

17:28.390 --> 17:31.620
<i>Dear Shin, I received a response 
from my master.</i>

17:31.620 --> 17:34.280
<i>She'll return as soon as 
she's finished with work.</i>

17:34.650 --> 17:37.580
<i>Please keep us informed 
if you leave Bayrelicht.</i>

17:38.010 --> 17:42.500
<i>P.S. I'm scared of how many questions 
my master asked about you.</i>

17:38.780 --> 17:44.290
<b>P.S. I'm scared of how many questions my master asked about you.
What did you do to her??</b>

17:42.500 --> 17:44.290
<i>What did you do to her?</i>

17:44.290 --> 17:47.310
<i>How many questions 
is a scary number of questions?</i>

17:48.040 --> 17:48.310
<b>Important</b>

17:48.310 --> 17:48.560
<b>Important</b>

17:48.330 --> 17:49.980
<i>Why is it flashing?</i>

17:48.560 --> 17:48.810
<b>Important</b>

17:48.810 --> 17:49.060
<b>Important</b>

17:49.060 --> 17:49.330
<b>Important</b>

17:49.330 --> 17:49.560
<b>Important</b>

17:49.560 --> 17:49.830
<b>Important</b>

17:49.830 --> 17:50.340
<b>Important</b>

17:52.190 --> 17:54.730
That's a letter of introduction 
from the Moon Sanctum.

17:55.290 --> 17:56.570
You know what this is?

18:03.830 --> 18:06.310
I wouldn't have thought you had one, too.

18:07.110 --> 18:09.150
Right back at you.

18:13.150 --> 18:15.320
So these are the Ghost Plains, huh?

18:17.000 --> 18:17.770
Lacia.

18:17.780 --> 18:18.820
Y-Yes?!

18:19.530 --> 18:21.070
Here's the holy prayer orb.

18:21.590 --> 18:23.820
You've gotta make sure you're holding it.

18:23.820 --> 18:27.750
Oh, shank— I mean, thank you.

18:38.990 --> 18:40.840
They're already here.

18:41.910 --> 18:43.600
Lacia, give it all you've got.

18:45.090 --> 18:45.970
Okay.

18:49.460 --> 18:50.600
Single Ablution!

18:54.470 --> 18:55.930
Attack the Biohounds.

18:55.930 --> 18:56.860
G-Got it!

18:57.630 --> 18:58.590
Heal!

19:05.030 --> 19:08.580
<i>Good. Healing magic works 
just like it does in the game.</i>

19:08.580 --> 19:09.850
The next group is coming!

19:14.880 --> 19:16.850
Break their limbs
so they can't counterattack.

19:16.850 --> 19:18.630
Don't tell me you can't pull that off.

19:18.630 --> 19:20.510
Who do you think you're talking to?

19:20.510 --> 19:21.340
Flashing Blossom!

19:24.070 --> 19:25.220
Not bad.

19:37.020 --> 19:38.940
What's this blue wall?

19:38.940 --> 19:41.860
It's a seal created by the guild.

19:42.700 --> 19:45.610
The undead beyond this point 
are on another level.

19:45.610 --> 19:46.690
Prepare yourselves.

19:46.690 --> 19:47.620
O-Okay.

19:56.910 --> 19:59.700
Rapt Raptors and Jumpkins.

19:59.700 --> 20:01.380
Looks like five in all.

20:02.450 --> 20:04.140
Wilhelm, you take the front.

20:04.500 --> 20:06.850
I'll stop the ones to our left.

20:06.850 --> 20:09.020
Makes sense.

20:09.020 --> 20:10.980
There are no other enemies nearby.

20:10.980 --> 20:12.910
Yuzuha, you handle things here.

20:17.750 --> 20:18.730
Heal!

20:23.270 --> 20:26.960
Good work. You've gained a lot of levels.

20:26.960 --> 20:30.790
I know! I've leveled up so much it's scary!

20:31.130 --> 20:33.600
It's because these monsters
outlevel you so much.

20:33.600 --> 20:34.790
You'll advance rapidly.

20:35.160 --> 20:38.860
By the time you learn Purify, 
you should be about level 150.

20:38.860 --> 20:40.300
I'm back.

20:40.810 --> 20:42.370
Welcome back, Wil.

20:42.370 --> 20:43.110
Here.

20:43.680 --> 20:45.430
SPLATTER

20:45.430 --> 20:49.810
No!

21:00.420 --> 21:05.900
<i>I heard unusually high-level Skullface Jacks 
had appeared in the Ghost Plains,</i>

21:05.900 --> 21:07.380
<i>so I came to defeat them,</i>

21:07.380 --> 21:09.240
<i>but these are exceptionally strong.</i>

21:10.240 --> 21:13.420
<i>Without this sword that came flying
 into my room that day,</i>

21:13.420 --> 21:15.240
<i>this battle would have been tough.</i>

21:15.240 --> 21:17.170
I'm worried about the other group.

21:17.170 --> 21:18.590
So am I.

21:18.590 --> 21:20.470
Allow me to handle it.

21:21.470 --> 21:22.680
Are you sure?

21:22.680 --> 21:23.510
Yes.

21:24.690 --> 21:26.510
Go around! Aim for the core!

21:26.510 --> 21:28.160
Its attacks are too powerful!

21:28.160 --> 21:30.370
Anyone with strength left, lend us your aid!

21:30.370 --> 21:32.270
Damn! What's wrong with this thing?

21:32.570 --> 21:33.930
We won't last like this...

21:33.930 --> 21:36.700
If we lose any more men, 
we won't be able to stop it.

22:02.530 --> 22:04.100
Schnee!

23:34.970 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Time
Episode 4
<b>After the Long Night</b></b>
